<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/044c402ff987> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Vanderbilt staff used ChatGPT to write email to students about MSU shooting" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2504" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/0562ac6d5685> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Camilla P. Benbow, Patricia and Rodes Hart Dean of Education and Human Development, released a statement in response to this incident." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2510" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/09624d8c4435> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "As a result of this collegiate contretemps, both Joseph and EDI assistant dean Hasina Mohyuddin, who was also responsible for the email, will \"step back from their responsibilities,\" according to Benbow." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2512" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/0b75c111b6d9> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Vanderbilt University is drawing heat from its student body for using ChatGPT to generate a communitywide letter." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2532" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/0f2bede1d218> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Thanks to its ever-growing base of knowledge input by users, the artificial intelligence chatbot known as ChatGPT can be used in a myriad of ways." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2513" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/0f492d1976da> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Vanderbilt University staff apologized after an email sent to students reflecting on the tragic Michigan State University shooting was written using Open AI's ChatGPT." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2510" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/12598398562d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "\"There is a sick and twisted irony to making a computer write your message about community and togetherness because you can't be bothered to reflect on it yourself,\" Laith Kayat, a senior at Vanderbilt who is from Michigan and whose sister goes to Michigan State University, told The Vanderbilt Hustler." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2531" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/1a175cd1b297> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "At the bottom of the email — in much smaller type — a line reads “Paraphrase from OpenAI’s ChatGPT AI language model, personal communication, February 15, 2023.”" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2502" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/1a24a3d90b6c> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "After the recent shooting at the University of Michigan, staff at Vanderbilt University in Nashville sent an email offering support and comfort to students." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2509" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/1f1b127b87d8> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "A college apologized for using ChatGPT to write an email to students about the Michigan State University shooting" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2503" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/1f7df34b4b38> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Nicole M. Joseph, the Associate Dean for Equity, Diversity and Inclusion, sent a follow-up email apologizing for using ChatGPT for this type of email on Friday, Feb. 17." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2510" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/21802de4628a> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The bizarre email, sent out Thursday by the Nashville institution’s Peabody Office of Equity, Diversity and Inclusion, made no mention of Vanderbilt-specific resources students could contact for support." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2502" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/239b8adee8c0> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Vanderbilt University's education school has apologized after sending a condolence message to staff and students regarding a recent shooting at Michigan State University." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2505" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/24cc299b98d1> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "OpenAI, the company that created ChatGPT, launched a free, online tool to distinguish human-generated and AI-generated text on Jan. 31." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2506" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/28d7bf633893> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Benbow claimed the 'development and distribution' of the email 'did not follow Peabody's normal processes,' nor was she or other university administrators aware of the email 'before it was sent.'" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2515" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/2a0086c7e0a2> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "During the review, Associate Dean Joseph and Assistant Dean Hasina Mohyuddin will step back from their responsibilities with the EDI office, said Benbow." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2510" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/344abf7fc412> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Vanderbilt University uses ChatGPT to address MSU shooting: ‘Sick’" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2502" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/3496308c8527> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Associate Dean for Equity, Diversity and Inclusion Nicole Joseph sent a follow-up, apology email to the Peabody community on Feb. 17 at 6:30 p.m. CST." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2506" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/3ce227787fe7> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Vanderbilt University staff apologized after an email sent to students reflecting on the tragic Michigan State University shooting was written using Open AI's ChatGPT." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2510" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/47c0b12a3bbe> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Nicole Joseph, the associate dean for the Office of Equity, Diversity and Inclusion, said the decision to use ChatGPT to write the email was made in “poor judgment.”" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2502" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/502d2793d6c8> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The ChatGPT-paraphrased email sounds like a boilerplate response that’s been scrapped together and doesn’t include any language specific to Vanderbilt, as noted by the Hustler." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2507" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/5cb7272d0023> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "\"Paraphrase from OpenAI’s ChatGPT AI language model, personal communication, February 15, 2023,\" it read, the _Vanderbilt Hustler_ reported." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2509" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/5e505d5e5871> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Vanderbilt University is drawing heat from its student body for using ChatGPT to generate a communitywide letter." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2532" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/68a209c0deae> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Students at Vanderbilt were outraged when they received the ChatGPT-generated email. Laith Kayat, a Vanderbilt senior from Michigan whose sister attends Michigan State, told the Hustler that the use of ChatGPT was “disgusting.”" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2507" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/69ef5d89761c> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "In a statement, Peabody College’s dean of education and human development, Camilla P. Benbow, said her office would be reviewing what happened before the email was sent." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2508" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/6bb6a8a610be> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "There are some uses that seem like common sense to avoid, but the Peabody Office of Equity, Diversity, and Inclusion (EDI) at Vanderbilt University missed that memo when its office sent out a letter on Feb. 15 to students about an on-campus shooting." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2513" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/6c77645fd78c> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Associate Dean for Equity, Diversity and Inclusion Nicole Joseph described as \"poor judgment,\" The Vanderbilt Hustler reported." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2531" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/6ca0e38e7f73> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "But it turns out the letter itself came from the AI program ChatGPT." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2514" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/6d20fd15d329> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Camilla Benbow, Peabody College's dean, said in a statement Saturday that the message was a paraphrased version of a ChatGPT-written draft and that Vanderbilt would investigate the decision to write and send the message." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2533" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/71ce955ac789> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The letter contains the byline of an associate dean named Nicole Joseph, who will now step back from her role over the decision to use ChatGPT." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2514" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/71df59181bdd> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "\"While we believe in the message of inclusivity expressed in the email, using ChatGPT to generate communications on behalf of our community in a time of sorrow and in response to a tragedy contradicts the values that characterize Peabody College,\" said Nicole Joseph, an associate dean at Peabody's EDI office responsible for the AI-email, in an apology email." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2512" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/7469f6fb342c> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "But at the bottom of the email, in small text, there was a footnote: \"Paraphrase from OpenAI's ChatGPT AI language model, personal communication, February 15, 2023.\"" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2531" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/7936f001b7ea> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Last week, staff at Vanderbilt University in Tennessee wrote a thoughtful and heartfelt letter about coming together as a community in response to the mass shooting at Michigan State University." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2514" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/8815fe66ed75> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "At the bottom, a line reads “Paraphrase from OpenAI's ChatGPT AI language model, personal communication, February 15, 2023.”" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2508" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/8dae487415cb> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "In Vanderbilt's case, it was used to construct a mass message regarding the Michigan State University shooting — a decision that Associate Dean for Equity, Diversity and Inclusion Nicole Joseph described as \"poor judgment,\" The Vanderbilt Hustler reported." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2531" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/8e4952d75702> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Peabody EDI Office responds to MSU shooting with email written using ChatGPT" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2506" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/91f764a18c2d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Staff at Vanderbilt University have apologised for 'poor judgement' after using ChatGPT to write a condolence email." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2503" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/93decf813588> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Hasina Mohyuddin, assistant dean of the office, will temporarily step back from their positions, according to a Feb. 18 email to the Peabody community." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2511" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/97dfd489c761> a airo:Evidence ;
