<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/05506f7b9c02> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Days after the deadly shooting at Michigan State University on Feb. 13, students at a university in Tennessee got an email of solidarity from their own administration." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2531" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/05f7530ea5d9> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "University Apologizes for Using AI to Write Letter to Students About Shooting" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2514" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/0a0629ca7e41> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Vice Provost and Dean of Students G. L. Black also sent an email to students on Feb. 14 regarding the shooting." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2506" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/1014a0dd1abe> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[2533] As students at Vanderbilt University's Peabody College grappled with the news of a deadly shooting at Michigan State University last week, those in the education college received an odd message from the administration." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2533" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/13b02eb0aab0> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Vanderbilt staff apologizes after using AI to send campus email about Michigan State shooting" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2517" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/1436c8172465> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "A college apologized for using ChatGPT to write an email to students about the Michigan State University shooting" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2503" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/14dbaaa2b889> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "After questions and backlash from the community, the Vanderbilt University's Peabody College of Education and Human Development released a statement apologizing for the email sent on Feb. 16." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2531" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/21c818256fc6> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "In small font, just above the signature line, a disclaimer appeared, indicating that the entire statement was a 'paraphrase from OpenAI's ChatGPT AI language model.'" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2532" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/224b619b8d2c> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The unfortunate email was sent out on Thursday from the Peabody Office of Equity, Diversity, and Inclusion (EDI) at Vanderbilt's Peabody College, and is about as vague and platitudinous as you'd expect from text composed by an AI that isn't even up to date with current events of the past two years.",
        "The unfortunate email was sent out on Thursday from the Peabody Office of Equity, Diversity, and Inclusion (EDI) at Vanderbilt's Peabody College." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2512" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/238e76a76f17> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The bizarre email, sent out Thursday by the Nashville institution’s Peabody Office of Equity, Diversity and Inclusion, made no mention of Vanderbilt-specific resources students could contact for support — and instead included several repetitive paragraphs offering vague thoughts about “creating a safe and inclusive environment.”" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2502" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/2a8dc49251aa> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "the email from the Peabody Office of Equity, Diversity and Inclusion at Vanderbilt University said." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2531" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/2ebbec197737> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Bloomberg News reported on Saturday (local time) that the Peabody College Secretariat at Vanderbilt University in Tennessee sent an email to students to express condolences for the victims of the indiscriminate shooting at Michigan State University." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2518" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/3e82f2f1d023> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The note at the bottom of the original email read, \"Paraphrase from OpenAI's ChatGPT AI language model, personal communication, February 15, 2023.\"" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2517" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/3f5cb5b49cb1> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The pair responded to the Michigan State University shooting in a Feb. 16 email to the Peabody community written using ChatGPT." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2511" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/40985ccd4439> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The Peabody Office of Equity, Diversity, and Inclusion sent students an email on February 16 reminding them to 'take care of each other' after the MSU shooting, although the email came off as kind and caring and offered students ways to help promote a caring environment with their peers, at the very bottom, it revealed it wasn't written by a human.",
        "The Peabody Office of Equity, Diversity, and Inclusion sent students an email on February 16 reminding them to 'take care of each other' after the MSU shooting." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2515" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/4483ee229250> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Paraphrase from OpenAI's ChatGPT AI language model, personal communication, February 15, 2023." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2512" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/519dcaf92cf8> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[2508] Staff members at Vanderbilt University sent an email to students using text generated by artificial intelligence to respond to the shooting at Michigan State University that killed three students." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2508" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/530ee589d5c3> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Peabody College’s dean of education and human development, Camilla P. Benbow, said her office is reviewing what happened." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2502" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/5ddf44660585> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Vanderbilt slammed for AI bot message on Michigan State shooting. ‘Sick and twisted’ " ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2531" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/5ea5b44f2cce> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "A smaller line of text in parentheses at the bottom of the message revealed that it had been written using the generative artificial intelligence program ChatGPT, as first reported by the Vanderbilt Hustler student newspaper.",
        "A smaller line of text in parentheses at the bottom of the message revealed that it had been written using the generative artificial intelligence program ChatGPT." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2533" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/68f324bf4882> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "A Vanderbilt Dean Used ChatGPT to Write Email About MSU Shooting" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2507" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/69a053f76f12> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "“While we believe in the message of inclusivity expressed in the email, using ChatGPT to generate communications on behalf of our community in a time of sorrow and in response to a tragedy contradicts the values that characterize Peabody College,” stated Nicole Joseph." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2504" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/69c2e14fbebe> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[2502] The bizarre email... made no mention of Vanderbilt-specific resources students could contact for support — and instead included several repetitive paragraphs offering vague thoughts about \"creating a safe and inclusive environment.\"" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2502" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/6ce47539c244> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "That's the lesson that two deans at Vanderbilt University learned the hard way last week when they thought (for some reason) it was a good idea to send a ChatGPT-generated email to students concerning the recent mass shooting at Michigan State University." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2512" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/70d09ae1c33e> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "University Apologizes for Sending Email About Mass Shooting Written With ChatGPT" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2512" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/79e2cade6b98> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Officials at the Office of Equity, Diversity and Inclusion at Peabody College admitted “poor judgement” in using the OpenAI chatbot for the email." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2504" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/7f6b3ce3a9e7> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "They used ChatGPT to write it." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2516" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/8e03fec1e726> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[2503] Vanderbilt University staff have apologised for \"poor judgement\" after using ChatGPT to write a condolence email in the wake of Monday's shooting at Michigan State University that left three students dead." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2503" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/91cfb10b164e> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Since the outrage begun, two deans who signed off on the email - Nicole Joseph and Hasina Mohyuddin - have temporarily stepped down while the Peabody EDI office 'reviews' the situation." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2515" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/94181b993d9f> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Vanderbilt University Staff Used ChatGPT To Write Email On MSU Shooting" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2508" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/94a7176e7c1d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[2508] In a statement, Peabody College’s dean of education and human development, Camilla P. Benbow, said her office would be reviewing what happened before the email was sent." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2508" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/9a2be2f4f7f3> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Associate Dean Nicole Joseph told the Vanderbilt Hustler that it was \"poor judgment\" to use ChatGPT \"to generate communications on behalf of our community in a time of sorrow and in response to a tragedy.\"" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2516" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/a037500642dc> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The problem was that a line at the bottom of the email said, “Paraphrase from OpenAI’s ChatGPT.”" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2518" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/a03d47b75186> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The note at the bottom of the original email read, \"Paraphrase from OpenAI's ChatGPT AI language model, personal communication, February 15, 2023.\"" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2517" .

